---
kind: lore
id: codex.stair
title: The Stair, as Wren learns it
series: stairCodex
---

<entry id="codexHounds" target="foe.cinderhound" category="codex" title="Cinderhounds">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Low, quick, and hot to the touch. They hunt in threes on the lower floors and go for the ankles. Maud was right about the ankles.
</entry>

<entry id="codexWraiths" target="foe.ashwraith" category="codex" title="Ashwraiths" when="entry.codexHounds.read">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: A wraith is what the Stair makes of a climber it keeps too long. Wren does not look at their faces. She looks at where they are going to be.
</entry>

<entry id="codexGatekeeper" target="foe.gatekeeper" category="codex" title="The Gatekeeper" when="holds('everSlew', ['gatekeeper'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Fourth-floor guardian. Carries a maul whose head bears a smith's mark. Once a man who thought he could hold the door.
</entry>

<entry id="codexWarden" target="foe.warden" category="codex" title="The Warden" when="holds('everSlew', ['warden'])">
  <match subject="user.knowsSableName">
    <when is="true">
      @narrator{code="0010"}: The top of the Stair. A coat of ash that took Sable forty years ago and has been wearing her patience ever since.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator{code="0020"}: The top of the Stair. A coat of ash with nobody inside it. The quiet one by the water will not say its name.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>
